course: dictionary
lesson: 5272
title: Jr: short for Junior
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Jr is an abbreviation, which means a short form of a longer word. It stands for «Junior», which means younger or the smaller of two. You can write it as Jr or Jr., and both are correct.
explain: People add Jr after a man's name when he has the same name as his father. Martin Luther King Jr. shares his name with his father, so Jr tells us which one we mean. The father is often called Sr., short for «Senior».
explain: Look at the words around it to check. «Sr. and Jr.» and «John Smith Jr.» both show a father and son with the same name. When you see a name followed by Jr., the person is the son.
fact: Jr is an abbreviation, a short form of the word «Junior».
fact: «Jr» is added after a man's name when he has the same name as his father, as in «John Smith Jr.».
fact: Martin Luther King Jr. is a famous name from history, and Jr. shows he has the same name as his father.
fact: Jr can also mean junior in other short forms, such as on sports teams or school forms, meaning younger or lower level.
fact: Context clues help: «Sr. and Jr.» together show a father and his son who share a name.
exercise: In «John Smith Jr.», what does Jr stand for? | *Junior | Joyful | Jersey | Judge
exercise: Why is «Jr» added to Martin Luther King Jr.'s name? | He was the best runner | He was born in January | He was the youngest in his class | *He has the same name as his father
exercise: What does «Jr» mean on a school form or sports team list? | A kind of sweet | *Younger or lower level | Older or top level | Very happy
test: «Sr. and Jr.» shows what? | Two different schools | Two football teams | Two brothers born in the same year | *A father and son with the same name
test: What is the short form of «Junior»? | Jn | Sr | Jun | *Jr
exam: Which name is most likely to end with Jr.? | *Sam Hill Jr., whose father is also called Sam Hill | Anna Green | Tom Lee | Mia Hill
